    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's just it. i'm not living a life worth celebrating. i'm just dragging their name through the mud every time i fail. i look at them and i just see what i'm not. it feels like the only way to actually respect what they built is to stop being the thing that breaks it. to just... stop being the problem.",
